%% F-11 IQC 待检隔离 —— 关键时序图（Mermaid）
%% 参与者用简化名，对应代码：
%%   PDA        -> client（扫码收货页 / 批量收货）
%%   ReceiptSvc -> server/modules/receipt/receipt.service.ts (scanReceipt / batchReceipt / submitIqc)
%%   DB         -> PostgreSQL 18 (inventory / iqc_lot / iqc_lot_receipt / receipt_order)
%%   IqcSvc     -> server/modules/iqc/iqc.service.ts (finalizeLotInventory / reviewReport)
%%   PickSvc    -> server/modules/workorder/workorder.service.ts（领料可用量）

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor WH as 仓管员(PDA)
    participant ReceiptSvc
    participant DB
    actor IQC as IQC检验员
    participant IqcSvc
    participant PickSvc

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over WH,DB: ① 收货：待检桶独立存在（与已放行行互不合并）
    WH->>ReceiptSvc: scanReceipt(qr, location, qty)
    ReceiptSvc->>DB: INSERT receipt_order (qr_content 唯一兜底)
    ReceiptSvc->>DB: INSERT inventory(stock_status='pending_qc', locked=true, reason='IQC待检')\nON CONFLICT (material,location,batch,stock_status) DO UPDATE qty+=excluded.qty
    Note right of DB: 冲突键含 'pending_qc' → 只会合并进待检桶<br/>已放行行(good)数量不变，天然隔离
    DB-->>ReceiptSvc: ok
    ReceiptSvc-->>WH: 收货单(received)
    end

    rect rgb(240,255,240)
    Note over ReceiptSvc,DB: ② 提交报检：同物理批次只允许一个 active 检验单号（F-10 修复点）
    WH->>ReceiptSvc: submitIqc()
    ReceiptSvc->>DB: pg_advisory_xact_lock(hash(4列分组键))   -- 排序后逐个加锁
    ReceiptSvc->>DB: SELECT receipt_order WHERE status='received' AND 无 lot 关联 FOR UPDATE
    ReceiptSvc->>DB: SELECT iqc_lot WHERE 4列键 AND status IN(active) FOR UPDATE
    alt 存在 active 批次（合并成一个检验单号）
        ReceiptSvc->>DB: UPDATE iqc_lot SET total_qty+=qty, last_receipt_date=max(...)
    else 不存在
        ReceiptSvc->>DB: INSERT iqc_lot(...) ON CONFLICT(4列) WHERE status IN(active) DO NOTHING
        Note right of DB: 仲裁索引唯一 → 只有 iqc_lot_active_dedup_uniq<br/>(4列 + NULLS NOT DISTINCT)，不再被无条件UNIQUE索引静默吞掉
        alt DO NOTHING 命中（真并发）
            ReceiptSvc->>DB: 重读 active 批次 FOR UPDATE 并累加 total_qty
        end
    end
    ReceiptSvc->>DB: INSERT iqc_lot_receipt (lot_id, receipt_id) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    ReceiptSvc->>DB: UPDATE receipt_order SET status='pending_iqc'
    ReceiptSvc-->>WH: {createdLotCount, lotNos}
    end

    rect rgb(255,250,235)
    Note over IQC,PickSvc: ③ 放行：按「报检数量」守恒迁移（不是整行搬迁）
    IQC->>IqcSvc: reviewReport(reportId, pass)
    IqcSvc->>DB: UPDATE iqc_report SET review_status='approved' WHERE IS DISTINCT FROM 'approved'
    Note right of DB: 影响 0 行 → 409（审批幂等 CAS）
    IqcSvc->>DB: UPDATE iqc_lot SET status='pass' WHERE id=:lot AND status IN(active)
    IqcSvc->>DB: SELECT inventory WHERE material,batch,stock_status='pending_qc' ORDER BY location_id,id FOR UPDATE
    IqcSvc->>IqcSvc: 守恒校验：SUM(qty) >= lot.total_qty ? 否则 409
    loop 每行 take = LEAST(row.qty, remaining)
        alt take == row.qty
            IqcSvc->>DB: DELETE inventory WHERE id=row.id
        else take < row.qty
            IqcSvc->>DB: UPDATE inventory SET quantity=qty-take WHERE id=row.id
            Note right of DB: 剩余仍为 pending_qc/locked=true → 留给下一张检验单
        end
        IqcSvc->>DB: INSERT inventory(good, locked=false, qty=take)\nON CONFLICT (4列) DO UPDATE qty+=take
    end
    IqcSvc->>DB: UPDATE receipt_order SET status='iqc_pass' (按 iqc_lot_receipt 精确范围)
    IqcSvc-->>IQC: 审批成功
    end

    rect rgb(250,240,250)
    Note over PickSvc,DB: ④ 领料只认 good 且未锁（pending_qc 永远不会被领走）
    PickSvc->>DB: SELECT inventory WHERE material AND stock_status='good' AND locked=false
    DB-->>PickSvc: 可用量（不含待检）
    end
